  "releaseNotes": "HttpSessionProtocol:\n    - Direct Field Access: Deprecated properties to eliminate JIT branching overhead.\n    - Nested Lazy Init: Rent heavy buffers only when the first byte arrives.\n    - Idle Efficiency: Zero RAM footprint for inactive connections.\n    - Latency Reduction: Achieved up to 50% faster TTFB via linear execution.",
